  </tr><tr>
    <td colspan="2" class="windowbg2" valign="top">Our season starts april 27 til the end of may,not sure of the day. we have a good flock of turkeys. most hunting is on state land although if you can find private land your chances improve. you can use shotgun or bow. i think for a license you just need your state hunting license or hunting safety card. permits and tags &nbsp;open to anyone with a current hunting license. for info you can call field headquarters at great swamp they will tell every thing you need to know. </td>
